            <creation xml:id="creation_186N200FB">
               <date isodate="1852" xml:id="date_N20375">1852</date>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_186N200F9">
               <p xml:id="idm94">When A.P. Berggreen published his "Melodier til den af Roeskilde-Præsteconvent udgivne Psalmebog" in 1853, he kept some of the most loved old chorales; however, he also asked some of his organist colleagues, among others Hartmann, to write some more appropriate tunes. His contributions were: "Giv jeg, o Herre, følger dig" (HartW 234), "Til Himlene rækker din Miskundhed, Gud" (HartW 233), "Stor er du, Gud!" (HartW 235); and the present hymn.</p>
            </history>
